    <string name="about_title">About the plugin</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_description">AI News adds a Smartspacer target that writes the news for you. Enter a topic, pick an AI provider — Gemini, Claude, OpenAI, DeepSeek, OpenRouter, Groq, Mistral, Grok, Qwen and other compatible APIs — and the model generates a short headline for your smartspace plus a full article you can read in a swipeable reader.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Not an official product of Smartspacer or any AI provider. Generated stories may contain inaccuracies.</string>
